# Signing and notarizing the macOS app. Copy to .env; `just build` reads it.
# Without these, the build is unsigned.

# The "Developer ID Application" certificate in your keychain, without its prefix.
# CSC_NAME="Your Name (TEAMID)"

# An App Store Connect API key, for notarization.
# APPLE_API_KEY=/path/to/AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8
# APPLE_API_KEY_ID=XXXXXXXXXX
# APPLE_API_ISSUER=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
